## 7. Evaluation

Use internal metrics (no labels assumed):

* **Silhouette score** (range \[-1,1]): higher is better; only defined when number of clusters \u2265 2 and not all points are noise.
* **Davies-Bouldin Index**: lower is better.
* **Calinski-Harabasz Index**: higher is better.

Also analyze:

* Fraction of points labeled as noise.
* Cluster sizes.

